{"3169510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last Line", "steam_appid": 3169510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169510/extras/7cd5828cd46295dc78237605816a08ae.poster.avif?t=1779217675\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169510/extras/7cd5828cd46295dc78237605816a08ae.webm?t=1779217675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169510/extras/7cd5828cd46295dc78237605816a08ae.mp4?t=1779217675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169510/extras/849cb7c044946f9f95dd9eda3041b2e1.webp?t=1779217675\" width=645 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169510/extras/c0bb4effb8da8f412c782147e9bb1130.poster.avif?t=1779217675\" width=614 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169510/extras/c0bb4effb8da8f412c782147e9bb1130.webm?t=1779217675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169510/extras/c0bb4effb8da8f412c782147e9bb1130.mp4?t=1779217675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A twin-stick shooter where you build, fight, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct deadly defenses, set up powerful turrets, and wipe out relentless enemy swarms with an arsenal of unique weapons and abilities. Strategize, adapt, and shoot nonstop—only the smartest and fastest will survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You work for <strong>Omni Mercs</strong>. When colonies fall, you are called. It’s your job to clean up the mess and eliminate all threats that wiped out human settlements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of arsenal and build your base to repel waves of enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169510/extras/e8c7dfc2b49b895d2c7c67819e1ff2a5.webp?t=1779217675\" width=645 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169510/extras/ccf9a9d4a5defd3da76c9d15431058e6.poster.avif?t=1779217675\" width=614 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169510/extras/ccf9a9d4a5defd3da76c9d15431058e6.webm?t=1779217675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169510/extras/ccf9a9d4a5defd3da76c9d15431058e6.mp4?t=1779217675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the ultimate base, packed with powerful turrets and essential structures like cloning units, radar systems, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the battlefield by placing indestructible nodes to trap enemies in deadly mazes and block key routes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic planning and quick thinking are your best weapons—survive, adapt, dominate! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169510/extras/4de746d288699e934a280c6ca01673b9.webp?t=1779217675\" width=645 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169510/extras/954718deac03ebeec971f62aaa68f269.poster.avif?t=1779217675\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169510/extras/954718deac03ebeec971f62aaa68f269.webm?t=1779217675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169510/extras/954718deac03ebeec971f62aaa68f269.mp4?t=1779217675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Master your playstyle by customizing unlocked skills to fit your strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from four distinct classes, each with powerful, unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your character’s strengths with new skills and perks - the path to victory is in your hands! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169510/extras/ecfd55bd629b15dcc359b3723363e7ac.webp?t=1779217675\" width=645 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169510/extras/30e33040a35bd56614d478c523fd0a15.poster.avif?t=1779217675\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169510/extras/30e33040a35bd56614d478c523fd0a15.webm?t=1779217675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169510/extras/30e33040a35bd56614d478c523fd0a15.mp4?t=1779217675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up in <strong>CO-OP </strong>with up to four players and take on the enemy together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate your tactics, combine unique abilities, and dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more allies you have, the more chaos you can unleash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vast Arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight waves of enemies swarming your base using 10 different weapons - each of them has two firing modes. Use them to create combo effects for maximum damage. Keep shooting as your second weapon is reloading in the meantime - NON STOP ACTION! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Campaign Mode and Survival Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through more and more challenging missions in campaign or try to survive as long as possible in survival mode and compete with other players on the leaderboard.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adapt your Strategy to your Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are simple brutes, some will try to pull you into the horde, and some will create more enemies upon death.  Build defenses that are best suited to eliminate swarming enemies. Know your enemies and then prioritize your targets to ensure your survival.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169510/extras/7cd5828cd46295dc78237605816a08ae.poster.avif?t=1779217675\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169510/extras/7cd5828cd46295dc78237605816a08ae.webm?t=1779217675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169510/extras/7cd5828cd46295dc78237605816a08ae.mp4?t=1779217675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class